WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Ten well-known SEO sites. About 300 pages each.

00:03.000 --> 00:09.000
A polite crawl: at most 2 requests a second, robots.txt respected.

00:09.000 --> 00:16.000
Each bar counts the gaps our crawler meets, page by page.

00:16.000 --> 00:23.000
Most lines stay flat. Spotless pages are the norm.

00:23.000 --> 00:26.500
Search Engine Roundtable: 298. 294 of them are one sitewide badge with no alt text.

00:26.500 --> 00:29.500
Semrush: 0. Neil Patel: 1. Surfer: 4.

00:29.500 --> 00:33.000
3 broken URLs in 2,521 pages. Data: CC BY 4.0.

